OL,3,GNEWSAHow 250 workers keep Wales' little
OL,4,Aslice of Italy ready for tourists      
OL,6,FA rare glimpse into the lives of       
OL,7,Fworkers at a tourism hotspot in Wales  
OL,8,Fwill be revealed in a new documentary. 
OL,10,FPortmeirion will show the day-to-day   
OL,11,Fwork of those involved in maintaining  
OL,12,Fthe resort in the Italianate-style     
OL,13,Fvillage, from caring for its buildings 
OL,14,Fand gardens to ensuring other services 
OL,15,Foperate smoothly.                      
OL,17,FIt comes as the location, which was the
OL,18,Fbackdrop to 1960s cult TV show The     
OL,19,FPrisoner, marks its 100th anniversary. 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
