OL,3,GNEWSAHow 250 workers keep Wales' little
OL,4,Aslice of Italy ready for tourists      
OL,6,FDesigned and constructed by architect  
OL,7,FSir Clough Williams-Ellis between 1925 
OL,8,Fand 1975, it has an eclectic mix of    
OL,9,Fstyles, architectural illusions and    
OL,10,Frepurposed structures collected from an
OL,11,Farray of grand buildings that faced    
OL,12,Fdecline and demolition in other        
OL,13,Flocations.                             
